# Intentionally retain:
# - constraint_check/temp_constraint_file.fdc (referenced by RISCV.pds)
# - myriscv/, source/, IP rtl/ and sim_lib/, sim/ scripts and TBs
# - MyCpu_test/ images, dumps, binaries, manifests and independent test IPs
# - selected regression logs and CSV summaries (no global *.log or *.csv rule)
# - modelsim.ini until portable library setup replaces its local mappings

